AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setForeclosureLtv()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when new foreclosure LTV is less than maxLtv
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketInvalidInput
├── when new foreclosure LTV equals maxLtv
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketInvalidInput
├── when new foreclosure LTV exceeds MATH_PRECISION
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketInvalidInput
└── when new foreclosure LTV is greater than maxLtv and at most MATH_PRECISION
    ├── it should update foreclosureLtv
    ├── it should emit SetForeclosureLtv with old and new values
    ├── when new value equals current value
    │   └── it should still emit and leave the same value
    ├── it should not accrue interest or query the oracle
    ├── it should not validate current position solvency or outstanding debt
    ├── it should permit lowering the threshold so an existing position becomes immediately foreclosable
    ├── it should not change market accounting or custody
    └── it should remain callable while paused or frozen
